sequenceDiagram
    participant User as "用户"
    participant Vue as "前端 (Vue.js)"
    participant API as "后端 API (Controller)"
    participant Service as "业务层 (Service)"
    participant DB as "数据库 (MyBatis)"

    Note over User, Vue: 登录流程
    User->>Vue: 输入用户名/密码并提交
    Vue->>API: POST /login (username, password)
    API->>Service: verify(user)
    Service->>DB: select * from t_user where username=?
    DB-->>Service: User Entity
    Service-->>API: Authentication Result
    API-->>Vue: Token / Success
    
    Note over User, Vue: 查询甜点列表
    User->>Vue: 点击“甜点管理”
    Vue->>API: GET /dessert?page=1&size=10
    API->>Service: list(param)
    Service->>DB: select * from dessert
    DB-->>Service: List<Dessert>
    Service-->>API: PageInfo<Dessert>
    API-->>Vue: JSON Response
    Vue-->>User: 渲染甜点列表表格
